==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Cosmic Eclipse|Lillipup|174}} from the {{TCG|Cosmic Eclipse}} expansion.
*'''Collect''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Movie VS Pack|Forina's Linoone|5}} from the {{TCG|Movie Commemoration VS Pack}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

